      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROLLING ROYALTY (6) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close third, one length from the winner Psionic Prowess (25.94) at this track. Overdue and is among the main hopes. BEXLEY (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.12) at this track behind Abode's Trilogy in a Grade 3/4. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Leading player again. STEELE WOLF (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 19.57 beating Solar Flare. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Has definite claims. ASTON BARBIE (7) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Big chance again.",
